  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The positive number <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"230 percent sign\"><mrow><mn>230</mn></mrow><mo>%</mo></math> of the number <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"a\"><mi>a</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"60 percent sign\"><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mo>%</mo></math> of the number <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math>. If <math alttext=\"c\"><mi>c</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"p percent sign\"><mi>p</mi><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"b\"><mi>b</mi>\n</math>, which of the following is closest to the value of <math alttext=\"p\"><mi>p</mi>\n</math>?</p>",
